PASS  greedy meets the budget   | freed 90 >= 78
PASS  and lands close to the exact optimum   | 12.8% above optimal on this instance
PASS  at network scale (thousands of tiny actions) the gap shrinks further   | each action frees a sliver of the budget — the regime where ratio-greedy excels
